# AI-Assistant - overview (always on)

AI-Assistant is a multi-form, EMR-assisted, AI-voice-assisted form completion
platform. The bundled Ohio Medicaid ODM 07216 form is one form pack, not a
hardcoded product boundary. Future forms should be added as schema/knowledgebase/
prompt/PDF or workflow metadata, with shared backend and UI behavior reused.

**Stack:** FastAPI + SQLAlchemy 2.0 (sync) + Pydantic v2 (backend), Next.js 14 +
React 18 + TypeScript (frontend), PostgreSQL, LangChain/OpenAI with deterministic
rule-based fallback, PyMuPDF for PDF output.

